      "created_at": "2015-07-02T17:43:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Choke who will become Chokepoint was a nemesis in the V5 decks with KNYFE as a nemesis. &nbsp;With the villains in VotM we've seen some of the same villains who had their own standalone villain decks reappear but with a different nemesis. &nbsp;I suspect if KNYFE is nemesis of Chokepoint that she won't be the only one. &nbsp;</p><p>Edit: I will add that Baron Blade in both forms has Legacy as a nemesis but I don't think we will see a repeat nemesis here. &nbsp;</p>",
